of those reach I2S_STATE_STOPPING by different routes through TX; DROP goes straight
to READY under irq_lock and never gets there at all.

The canary stamps every free RX block with a known pattern after the stream is stopped,
waits 50 ms, and counts how many came back written to. On stock upstream it is 1 of 8.


